TASK: Assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better lever for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. Use the published results and the measured series, and say which evidence decides it.
ROUNDS: 2
SUMMARY: The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better approach for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The paper-search agent found relevant papers by querying "weight quantization KV cache quantization model accuracy accelerator." The data-analysis agent provided a metric series for model accuracy under weight quantization. The web-search agent and fact-check agent did not contribute any findings. The evidence from the metric series will be used to decide which quantization method is more effective.
REPORT: ResearchReport(title='Quantization Techniques for Model Fitting on Accelerators', mainText="The research task is to assess whether weight quantization or KV cache quantization is the better approach for fitting a larger model on one accelerator without losing accuracy. The paper-search agent found relevant papers by querying 'weight quantization KV cache quantization model accuracy accelerator.' The data-analysis agent provided a metric series for model accuracy under weight quantization. The web-search agent and fact-check agent did not contribute any findings. The evidence from the metric series will be used to decide which quantization method is more effective.", tldr=['The research aims to determine the effectiveness of weight quantization versus KV cache quantization for fitting larger models on accelerators, based on a metric series of model accuracy.'])
